# Not written:
#   global/admins_continue>vs_web6/web_in: no IPv4 address as the destination
#   global/admins_continue>vs_web6/(default): no IPv4 address as the destination
#   global/ping_in@vs_outbound: its services cannot be written: an ICMP type, ICMPv6, SCTP or another IP protocol: a custom service of Cato is TCP, UDP or ICMP
